    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 포켓몬센터에서 일하고 있는 만큼\n포켓몬을 회복시키는 게 특기라<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n제 기술을 포켓몬에게도 가르쳐 줬어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC13CD130C5D0C11C0020C77CD558ACE00020C788B2940020B9CCD07C000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020D68CBCF5C2DCD0A4B2940020AC8C0020D2B9AE30B77C00100001BE00000AC81C0020AE30C220C7440020D3ECCF13BAACC5D0AC8CB3C40020AC00B974CCD00020C92CC5B4C694002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬의 HP를\n회복시키는 기술을 말이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC758002000480050B97C000AD68CBCF5C2DCD0A4B2940020AE30C220C7440020B9D0C774C5D0C694002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떠세요? 회복이 특기인\n제 포켓몬들과 승부해 보시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A0C138C694003F0020D68CBCF5C7740020D2B9AE30C778000AC81C0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4ACFC0020C2B9BD80D5740020BCF4C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부를 하실 거라면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558C2E40020AC70B77CBA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "회복이 특기인\n제 포켓몬들과 승부해 보시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D68CBCF5C7740020D2B9AE30C778000AC81C0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4ACFC0020C2B9BD80D5740020BCF4C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쓰러뜨릴 공격력과 자신이 없다면\n승부를 받아들이지 않는 게 최선이긴 하죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C4F0B7ECB728B9B40020ACF5ACA9B825ACFC0020C790C2E0C7740020C5C6B2E4BA74000AC2B9BD80B97C0020BC1BC544B4E4C774C9C00020C54AB2940020AC8C0020CD5CC120C774AE340020D558C8E0002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상대를 쓰러뜨렸다고 생각한 그 순간\n도로 회복해 버리는 절망을 맛보도록 하세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1B300B97C0020C4F0B7ECB728B838B2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D55C0020ADF80020C21CAC04000AB3C4B85C0020D68CBCF5D5740020BC84B9ACB2940020C808B9DDC7440020B9DBBCF4B3C4B85D0020D558C138C694002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "압도적인 공격력과\n위협적인 지구력을 모두 갖추셨군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C555B3C4C801C7780020ACF5ACA9B825ACFC000AC704D611C801C7780020C9C0AD6CB825C7440020BAA8B4500020AC16CD94C168AD70C694002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "회복하는 것만으로는 이길 수 없다는 건\n저도 잘 알아요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그래서 신중히 기술을 골랐는데도\n제가 지고 말았네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D68CBCF5D558B2940020AC83B9CCC73CB85CB2940020C774AE380020C2180020C5C6B2E4B2940020AC74000AC800B3C40020C7980020C54CC544C694002E00100001BE01000AADF8B798C11C0020C2E0C911D7880020AE30C220C7440020ACE8B790B294B370B3C4000AC81CAC000020C9C0ACE00020B9D0C558B124C694002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님이 강했고, 제가 약했다는 걸\n인정할 수밖에 없겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108B2D8C7740020AC15D588ACE0002C0020C81CAC000020C57DD588B2E4B2940020AC78000AC778C815D5600020C218BC16C5D00020C5C6ACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 저는 포켓몬센터에서 일하는 몸!\n특기는 포켓몬을 회복시키는 것!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002C0020C800B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC13CD130C5D0C11C0020C77CD558B2940020BAB80021000AD2B9AE30B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020D68CBCF5C2DCD0A4B2940020AC83002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니, 승부에서 상처 입은 포켓몬들을\n회복시키겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C8002C0020C2B9BD80C5D0C11C0020C0C1CC980020C785C7400020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C744000AD68CBCF5C2DCD0A4ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "셀프로 포켓몬을 맡기고 회복시키는 게\n조금 우습긴 하지만요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C140D504B85C0020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020B9E1AE30ACE00020D68CBCF5C2DCD0A4B2940020AC8C000AC870AE080020C6B0C2B5AE340020D558C9C0B9CCC694002E002E002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 맡긴 제 포켓몬이\n모두 건강해졌습니다! ...헤헷!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020B9E1AE340020C81C0020D3ECCF13BAACC774000ABAA8B4500020AC74AC15D574C84CC2B5B2C8B2E400210020002E002E002ED5E4D5F7002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님의 포켓몬도 언제든지\n건강하게 만들어 드릴 테니 말씀해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
